ok - the captain picks an option, optionally adds a note and queues; answered cards shrink, keep Change answer and survive a reload
ok - the page ages its own data from live to stale to out of date
ok - refresh rebuilds only when due and keeps the last good board on failure
ok - open serves the board, binds its answers, then arms the source
ok - answered questions leave the page on the next refresh, and work an answer lets continue moves to its lane
ok - every project and every lane row says what it is, from its note or hold reason, or says that no explanation is recorded
ok - a registered second mate's workers and queued work say what they are, and their raw notes stay off the page
ok - a question typed on the board shows there as not answered yet, then with its answer, and its result cannot be marked handled without one or a reason
